      "result": "<task id=\"ses_f4a15438dffeex1BrgypAF4LBb\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n# Native Twenty Primitives — Evidence-Backed Inventory\n\nRoot: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite`. All paths absolute.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Charts / visualization primitives\n\n**Bottom line:** There are **no chart primitives in `twenty-ui`**. All charting is private to `twenty-front` under `modules/page-layout/widgets/graph/`. Backing libraries are **Nivo** (`@nivo/core`, `@nivo/line`, `@nivo/pie`) plus **`@nivo/radial-bar` (declared but unused)** and **`d3-shape`**. Bar charts are **custom SVG** built on a `chart-core`, not Nivo.\n\nAbsence of chart code in `twenty-ui`:\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-ui/src/` contains no chart/graph component directory; `data-display/` has no chart entries (only Chip, Avatar, Status, Tag, etc.).\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-ui/package.json` — no `nivo`, `recharts`, `d3`, `chart.js`, `echarts`, `victory`, `apexcharts`, `plotly` dependency (grep returns nothing).\n- Only chart-adjacent item is an icon: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-ui/src/icon/components/IconChartBarHorizontal.tsx`.\n\nDependencies (actual):\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/package.json:57-60` — `@nivo/core`, `@nivo/line`, `@nivo/pie`, `@nivo/radial-bar` all `^0.99.0`.\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/package.json:90` — `\"d3-shape\": \"^3.2.0\"`.\n- `@nivo/radial-bar` has **no import anywhere** in `packages/` (grep for `@nivo/radial-bar` across `.ts/.tsx` returns nothing) — declared but unused.\n\nChart type enumeration (frontend):\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/side-panel/pages/page-layout/types/GraphType.ts:1-7` — `GraphType { VERTICAL_BAR, HORIZONTAL_BAR, LINE, PIE, AGGREGATE }`.\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/side-panel/pages/page-layout/constants/GraphTypeInformation.ts:19-52` — per-type label/icon/settings (Vertical Bar, Horizontal Bar, Pie, Line, Aggregate).\n\nComponent inventory (all front-internal):\n- Dispatcher: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/page-layout/widgets/graph/components/GraphWidget.tsx:8-29` — switches on `configurationType` to Aggregate/Pie/Bar/Line renderers.\n- Entry renderer: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/page-layout/widgets/graph/components/GraphWidgetRenderer.tsx:11-21`.\n- Line: `GraphWidgetLineChartRenderer.tsx`, `GraphWidgetLineChart.tsx` — uses Nivo `ResponsiveLine` (`.../graph-widget-line-chart/components/GraphWidgetLineChart.tsx:32,37,310`) and `d3-shape` for custom area paths (`.../utils/computeLineAreaPath.ts:1`).\n- Pie: `GraphWidgetPieChart.tsx` — Nivo `ResponsivePie` (`.../graph-widget-pie-chart/components/GraphWidgetPieChart.tsx:23`); custom arcs via `@nivo/arcs` (`.../components/CustomArcsLayer.tsx:5`).\n- Bar: custom SVG; `useBarChartLayout`, `BarChartLayers`, and `chart-core` scales (`.../graph-widget-bar-chart/utils/computeBarPositionContext.ts:1-2` importing `computeBandScale`, `computeValueScale`).\n- Aggregate: no chart lib; string/value display (`.../graph-widget-aggregate-chart/components/GraphWidgetAggregateChartRenderer.tsx`).\n- Shared `chart-core`: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/page-layout/widgets/graph/chart-core/` (axis layers, band/value scale utils, grid layer).\n\nOther chart usages outside page-layout:\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/settings/admin-panel/health-status/components/SettingsAdminWorkerMetricsGraph.tsx:8` — `ResponsiveLine` from `@nivo/line`.\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/settings/usage/components/UsagePieChart.tsx:5` — `ResponsivePie` from `@nivo/pie`.\n\nServer data layer (charts are backed by group-by/aggregate services):\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2