        "result": "<task id=\"ses_f4a153b23ffeMgg6lROG4xC3cq\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\nAudit complete. All findings below are from local evidence only (installed `node_modules` and repo files); nothing was modified.\n\n## 1. First-party package licenses\n\n| Package | `license` field | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| Root `a2e-suite` | `AGPL-3.0` | `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/package.json:25` |\n| `twenty-front` | **(field absent)** — governed by root LICENSE (AGPLv3 + `/* @license Enterprise */` commercial files) | `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/package.json` (no license key); `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/LICENSE:2-7` |\n| `twenty-ui` | `MIT` | `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-ui/package.json:5` + `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-ui/LICENSE` |\n| `twenty-shared` | `MIT` | `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-shared/package.json:8` + `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-shared/LICENSE` |\n\nThe root `LICENSE` confirms: main project AGPLv3, some files commercial (`/* @license Enterprise */`), and specifically names `twenty-shared`, `twenty-ui`, `twenty-sdk`, `twenty-client-sdk`, `create-twenty-app`, and `packages/twenty-apps` as MIT (`/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/LICENSE:4-7`). Note `twenty-front` is **not** in that MIT list, so it falls under AGPLv3.\n\n## 2. Third-party editor/export packages\n\n| Package | Installed version | License | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `@blocknote/core` | 0.51.4 | **MPL-2.0** | `.../node_modules/@blocknote/core/package.json`; `LICENSE:1`; `README.md:91` |\n| `@blocknote/react` | 0.51.4 | **MPL-2.0** | `.../node_modules/@blocknote/react/package.json`; `LICENSE:1` |\n| `@blocknote/mantine` | 0.51.4 | **MPL-2.0** | `.../node_modules/@blocknote/mantine/package.json`; `LICENSE:1` |\n| `@blocknote/server-util` (present, not requested) | 0.51.4 | MPL-2.0 | `.../node_modules/@blocknote/server-util/package.json` |\n|